<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 35.63 to 7305.29.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.46 to 441.64.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.14.</p>
<p>Advances outpaced declines 1489 to 957.</p>
<p>Volume was 452,623,120 compared with 466,692,430 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
